+/*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * Function:	MPT_DeInitAdapter()
+ *
+ * Overview:	Extra DeInitialization for Mass Production Test.
+ *
+ * Input:		PADAPTER	pAdapter
+ *
+ * Output:		NONE
+ *
+ * Return:		NONE
+ *
+ * Revised History:
+ *	When		Who		Remark
+ *	05/08/2007	MHC		Create Version 0.
+ *	05/18/2007	MHC		Add normal driver MPHalt code.
+ *
